msgid "The fabric inventory could not be read. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "I-inventory ye-fabric ayikwazanga ukufundwa. Bheka ilogi ye-Cacti."

#: lib/InventoryPage.php
msgid "Transmit wait counts ticks in which a port had data to send but could not send it, for lack of credits or arbitration. A high value shows congestion toward the remote end; it does not show that the port or its cable is faulty. The tick length is not published for current link speeds, so values are ticks per second, not time."
msgstr "Ukulinda kokuthumela kubala amathikhi lapho i-port yayinedatha okumele iyithumele kodwa yehluleka ukuyithumela, ngenxa yokuntuleka kwamakhredithi noma i-arbitration. Inani eliphezulu libonisa ukuminyana ngakohlangothi olukude; alibonisi ukuthi i-port noma ikhebula layo linephutha. Ubude bethikhi abushicilelwanga ngezivinini zamanje zesixhumanisi, ngakho amanani angamathikhi ngesekhondi, hhayi isikhathi."

