#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php
msgid "The sweep runs as root. Run the poller as an unprivileged account with read access to the umad devices through a group."
msgstr "Ukuhlola kusebenza njenge-root. Sebenzisa i-poller njenge-akhawunti engenamalungelo aphelele enokufinyelela kokufunda kumadivayisi e-umad ngeqembu."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool has the setuid or setgid bit. The plugin never needs it."
msgstr "Ithuluzi lokuxilonga linebhithi le-setuid noma le-setgid. I-plugin ayilidingi nakancane."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool or its directory can be written by an account other than its owner, or by the poller account. Whoever can write it chooses what the poller runs."
msgstr "Ithuluzi lokuxilonga noma uhla lwalo lwemibhalo lungabhalwa yi-akhawunti engeyona yomnikazi walo, noma yi-akhawunti ye-poller. Noma ubani ongalibhala nguye okhetha ukuthi i-poller isebenzisa ini."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php
msgid "A umad device is readable or writable by every account, so any local user can query the fabric. Restrict it to a group."
msgstr "Idivayisi ye-umad ingafundwa noma ibhalwe yiwo wonke ama-akhawunti, ngakho noma yimuphi umsebenzisi wendawo angabuza i-fabric. Yilinganisele eqenjini."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "Unknown warning"
msgstr "Isexwayiso esingaziwa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Diagnostics Tools"
msgstr "Amathuluzi Okuxilonga"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute directory, on each poller that sweeps a fabric, holding perfquery, ibnetdiscover, and iblinkinfo. The Debian and Ubuntu packages install them in /usr/sbin. No other program is ever run from it."
msgstr "Uhla lwemibhalo oluphelele, ku-poller ngayinye ehlola i-fabric, olugcina i-perfquery, i-ibnetdiscover, ne-iblinkinfo. Amaphakheji e-Debian ne-Ubuntu awafaka ku-/usr/sbin. Alukho olunye uhlelo olwake lwasetshenziswa kulo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Tool Directory"
msgstr "Uhla Lwemibhalo Lwethuluzi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Name Map"
msgstr "Imephu Yamagama Enodi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Optional absolute path to an infiniband-diags node name map file. Names it supplies are shown only; identity is always the node GUID."
msgstr "Indlela ephelele yokuzikhethela eya efayeleni lemephu yamagama enodi ye-infiniband-diags. Amagama eliwahlinzekayo ayaboniswa kuphela; ubunikazi buhlala buyi-GUID yenodi."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Datagram Timeout"
msgstr "Ukuphela Kwesikhathi Kwe-Datagram"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Milliseconds each management datagram may take before the tools retry it (their -t option)."
msgstr "Amamilisekhondi i-datagram ngayinye yokuphatha engawathatha ngaphambi kokuba amathuluzi ayizame futhi (inketho yawo engu--t)."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Command Timeout"
msgstr "Ukuphela Kwesikhathi Komyalo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one tool run may take before it is stopped and recorded as failed."
msgstr "Imizuzwana ukusebenza kwethuluzi okukodwa okungayithatha ngaphambi kokuba kumiswe futhi kurekhodwe njengokwehlulekile."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB one tool run may print. Larger output is discarded and recorded as failed."
msgstr "Ama-KiB ukusebenza kwethuluzi okukodwa okungawaphrinta. Okukhiphayo okukhulu kuyalahlwa futhi kurekhodwe njengokwehlulekile."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Output"
msgstr "Okukhiphayo Okukhulu Kakhulu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Sweep"
msgstr "Ukuhlola"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Time Budget"
msgstr "Isabelo Sesikhathi Senodi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one node sweep may spend reading counters. Ports not reached are read in the next cycle."
msgstr "Imizuzwana ukuhlola kwenodi eyodwa okungayichitha kufunda izibali. Izimbobo okungafinyelelwanga kuzo zifundwa emjikelezweni olandelayo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Failed ports after which a node sweep stops for this cycle. A port that does not answer costs several seconds."
msgstr "Izimbobo ezehlulekile okuthi ngemva kwazo ukuhlola kwenodi kume kulo mjikelezo. Imbobo engaphenduli idla imizuzwana eminingana."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Failure Budget"
msgstr "Isabelo Sokwehluleka Kwenodi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Index Down Ports"
msgstr "Faka Kuhlu Izimbobo Eziphansi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, the Fabric Port data query also lists ports that are down and have no remote end, such as unused adapter ports. Cleared, they are left out until they come up."
msgstr "Uma kumakiwe, umbuzo wedatha we-Fabric Port uphinde ufake izimbobo eziphansi nezingenasiphelo esikude, njengezimbobo ze-adaptha ezingasetshenziswa. Uma kususiwe ukumaka, zishiywa ngaphandle zize zivuke zisebenze."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Khipha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Gcina Amathebula E-plugin Uma Ukhipha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its fabrics, inventory, and samples. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the inventory first from the Fabric Admin page. The fabric is never contacted either way."
msgstr "Uma kumakiwe, ukukhipha i-plugin kugcina ama-fabric ayo, uhlu lwempahla, namasampula. Susa ukumaka ukuze ukukhipha kuzisuse; khipha uhlu lwempahla kuqala ekhasini le-Fabric Admin. I-fabric ayithintwa nakancane nganoma iyiphi indlela."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory must be an absolute path of letters, digits, dots, dashes, underscores, and slashes, with no trailing slash."
msgstr "Uhla lwemibhalo lwethuluzi kufanele lube yindlela ephelele yezinhlamvu, amadijithi, amachashazi, amadeshi, ama-underscore, nama-slash, ngaphandle kwe-slash ekugcineni."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory does not exist or is not a directory."
msgstr "Uhla lwemibhalo lwethuluzi alukho noma alulona uhla lwemibhalo."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory path contains a symbolic link. Enter the real path."
msgstr "Indlela yohla lwemibhalo lwethuluzi iqukethe isixhumanisi esingokomfanekiso. Faka indlela yangempela."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory is not owned by root."
msgstr "Uhla lwemibhalo lwethuluzi alulona olwe-root."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory can be written by its group or by others."
msgstr "Uhla lwemibhalo lwethuluzi lungabhalwa yiqembu lalo noma ngabanye."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool is not owned by root."
msgstr "Ithuluzi lokuxilonga alilona elwe-root."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool can be written by its group or by others."
msgstr "Ithuluzi lokuxilonga lingabhalwa yiqembu lalo noma ngabanye."

